WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:07,980
I haven't woken up yet. If I'm sleepy, I'll take a nap.

2
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:10,460
Whose news

3
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:13,710
My senior asked me to sit downstairs

4
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:15,150
You sleep a little longer

5
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:22,960
Here you go. Didn’t sleep well.

6
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:25,430
Or are your colleagues bullying you?

7
00:00:25,430 --> 00:00:29,170
No, it has nothing to do with them

8
00:00:29,170 --> 00:00:33,090
I checked last night and found out that it was really the second young master of the Xiao family.

9
00:00:33,090 --> 00:00:35,730
The Xiao family is rich and powerful in the H City Safety Zone

10
00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:37,210
catch this line

11
00:00:37,210 --> 00:00:40,150
Was that Mr. Xiao from your company last night?

12
00:00:40,150 --> 00:00:42,670
Be careful. Introduce me.

13
00:00:43,030 --> 00:00:46,750
Helpful for my business and craft projects

14
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:48,110
Who is on your team?

15
00:00:48,110 --> 00:00:50,110
Does Mr. Xiao have any artistic skills? What about the others?

16
00:00:50,110 --> 00:00:51,190
What does he usually like?

17
00:00:51,190 --> 00:00:52,590
All ignored

18
00:00:52,590 --> 00:00:54,510
You still want to discuss business with my boss?

19
00:00:54,510 --> 00:00:56,470
You, a woman, don’t understand this.

20
00:00:56,470 --> 00:00:58,630
Just tell me the information I want

21
00:00:58,630 --> 00:01:00,230
I naturally know how to do the rest
